5x the prior 10-day average of 1.5M. It held, never closing below the level three days running, reached a best close of $22.84, and the chart ends at $21.95.","lesson":"This is an example of a textbook breakout: a base, then a close above it on heavy volume, and it held. This is the pattern the rules are built around."}}